  {
    "id": 2007009020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──あ、Ｐたんだ\r\nお疲れ様でーす",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "007",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、お疲れ結華\r\nどうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ちょっと買い出しにねー\r\nみんな部屋で盛り上がっちゃってるから",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もー、びっくりするほど喉が渇く渇く！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、なるほど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーは何見てたの？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も飲み物──\r\nと、あと小腹が空いたような気もして……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あはは、晩ご飯あんなに出てたのに！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほんとになぁ\r\nすごく美味しかったし、朝も楽しみなんだけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ご当地のお菓子への興味を振り切れないんだ……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "太らないようにね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ぐっ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ほらＰたん、こっちのおまんじゅうとか美味しそうだよ？\r\n薄皮でこしあんたっぷりだって！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "一口スイートポテトも人気なんだ～\r\n芋は安定だよねぇ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あっ！\r\nかりんとうとかおせんべいもいいんじゃない？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "待ってくれ、待ってくれ結華……！\r\n俺今ショック受けつつぐらついてるから……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "やだなぁ\r\nわかっててやってるんだよぅ",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "こっちもそれをわかってるから言ってるんだよ……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_bad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_bad_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020101,
    "speaker": "結華＆プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あははっ",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020101"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なんかさ、修学旅行みたい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "みんなで泊まりで出かけてさ、\r\nなんてことない言い合いですっごく笑って",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、わかる……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あとはアレだろ、普段そんなタイプでもないのに\r\nしおりに書いてあるルールを破ってみたりとか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あらー、Ｐたん結構悪ガキタイプ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さぁ？　どうだろうな？\r\n結華は？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ふふーん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "消灯時間過ぎてから友達の部屋に行こうとしたけど、\r\n廊下で先生が見張ってたから引き下がったことならあるよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああー……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "先生がさぁ、ちょうど三峰たちの部屋の前に\r\n椅子置いて待機してんの。ひどくない？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかるぞ……！\r\nそういう時に限って体育の先生とか、一番怖い人なんだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そうそうそう！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "何人か部屋のドア開けて様子見たりしてたんだけど\r\n『次顔出したやつは反省部屋』とか言われて",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、それは出られない……\r\n……で？　結華は捕まってないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "もちろん！\r\nドアスコープで確認できたからね、なんせ目の前だから",
    "charAnim1": "wink",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははは……！\r\nラッキーなんだか、なんなんだか……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "大目に見てくれたっていいのにね\r\n特別な日なんだし",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……まぁ\r\n今となっては、先生の苦労と責任もわからなくはないけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──よし！　三峰お茶見てくる！\r\nあんまり長居してると心配させちゃうかもだし！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020220"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
