  {
    "id": 2007009020230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──じゃあ、三峰の部屋はこっちなので",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "結局いっぱい買ったみたいだけど、\r\n夜食べるのはほどほどにしなよ～？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、心配ありがとうな\r\n──それと結華",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は引率の先生じゃないから──\r\nこれ、差し入れだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007009020260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700902/2007009020260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなによろしくな\r\n明日に支障が出ない範囲で楽しんでくれ",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
